fkern-iter-logger
=================

This software is a derivative work based on FEMM (Finite Element Method
Magnetics) 4.2 by David Meeker: https://www.femm.info/

FEMM 4.2 and this derivative work are distributed under the Aladdin Free Public
License. The complete license terms are available from the official FEMM
website:

https://www.femm.info/doku/doku.php?id=license

Original FEMM software:
Copyright (C) David Meeker. All rights reserved.

Newton-Raphson iteration logging modification:
Copyright (C) 2026 Federico Valpiani. All rights reserved.

Modification included in this repository:
- Writing the total iteration count produced by the FEMM magnetic solver to a
  plain-text `.iter` file after a successful analysis.
